#. オラ、さっさと
#. 思い出しやがれッ！
msgctxt "0001 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Come on, bitches!\n"
"Remember or die!"
msgstr ""

#. 外の世界で
#. 何があったんだぁ！？
msgctxt "0002 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "What the fuck happened outside!?"
msgstr ""

#. 思い出すも何も…
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"You want us to remember\n"
"or whatever, but..."
msgstr ""

#. あんな<CLT 9>意味不明の
#. 映像<CLT>だけじゃ…
msgctxt "0004 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"When it comes to that <CLT 9>crazy\n"
"confusing video<CLT> you showed us..."
msgstr ""

#. なんも、
#. わかんねーっての！！
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "...I don't understand a damn thing!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 9>さっきの映像<CLT>はなんだ…？
msgctxt "0006 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"What's the meaning\n"
"of <CLT 9>the footage we saw<CLT>...?"
msgstr ""

#. また…
#. お前の悪ふざけか…？
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Is this another one of your practical jokes?"
msgstr ""

#. そもそも…
#. 思い出せって言うけど…
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I mean,\n"
"you're telling us to remember, but..."
msgstr ""

#. 何を思い出せばいいの！？
msgctxt "0009 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"...what am I supposed\n"
"to be remembering!?"
msgstr ""

#. 誰も…
#. <CLT 9>何も思い出せない<CLT>んじゃ…
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I-If <CLT 9>nobody can \n"
"remember anything<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. …終わりよ！
#. 終わるしかないのね！
msgctxt "0011 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"...this is the end f-for all of us!\n"
"What other ch-choice do we have!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>ぜんっぜん意味不明じゃねーよ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>I don't know what it means!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>デストロイな絶望だよ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>It's a despair that'll seek and destroy!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>おや…わからないのですか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>What, you don't get it?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>十神家の御曹司ともあろう方が…<CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>For the apparent heir to the Togami legacy...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>悪ふざけとは心外です。<CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>A practical joke? Really?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>いつだって真剣に絶望してます。<CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>No. My despair is always serious business.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>そうよ今こそ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Even now...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>あなた達に眠る力…<CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>The power that lies within you...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>セブンセンシズ的な何か…<CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Is it some kinda sixth sense?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>それを解放するのよ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Hurry up and release it!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>そんなの無いですけどね…<CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>There's no such thing...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>ふふふ…コウコツです。<CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Hmhmhm... I'm so ecstatic!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>あなた方のその表情…<CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Look at your faces...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>終わりましょうか…？<CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Well, should we finish this?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>この裁判も…あなた達の希望も。<CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>This trial represents your own hope, right?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
